{"run_id": "RUN-58a0deda72c2", "model": "minimax-m3", "prompt_version": "v1_baseline", "params_id": "A", "sample_id": "S10", "task_category": "information_integration", "repeat": 0, "cache_key": "bb4d9326f78a796f", "status": "ok", "degraded": null, "reasoning_only": false, "from_cache": true, "detail": null, "answer": "**配网失败排查顺序：**\n\n1. **第一步**：确认路由器为 2.4GHz 频段；\n2. **第二步**：重启路由器；\n3. **第三步**：重新长按复位键配网。\n\n**技术支持联系方式：**\n\n- **服务热线**：400-820-1234\n- **服务时间**：每日 9:00-18:00，节假日顺延", "scores": {"answer_accuracy": 1.0, "rejection_correctness": 1.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "format_compliance": 1.0, "latency_ms": 2936, "rejected": false}, "scoring_revision": "METRICS@1.1.0"}
